WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:03,670
Lin Mu

2
00:00:03,890 --> 00:00:05,330
What is your family background?

3
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,040
I didn’t buy this pet life at home.

4
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:10,810
where did that come from

5
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:11,930
Don't say yes

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,770
Received from the school training center

7
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,490
It’s better that you don’t know this

8
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,100
It's really for your own good

9
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,940
No, I want to know

10
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:26,350
Then I would rather you treat us a little bit worse, right, right?

11
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:32,500
We don't need you to be nice to us. Just say it.

12
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:40,670
My ghost tiger is a gift from my girlfriend.

13
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:44,180
I shouldn't ask me too

14
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,660
I also owe it to myself

15
00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:50,290
The girlfriend you are talking about

16
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:53,530
Is this a joke from Lin Da? Yes

17
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,940
Am I looking for trouble? Absolutely.

18
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:09,810
I must be very worried about what happened to Lin Mu and the others.

19
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:12,150
Why did you stop talking all of a sudden?

20
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,840
Probably thinking about life
